# Rofellos, Llanowar Emissary: "{T}: Add {G} for each Forest you control" (CR 605.1a, 106.4, 205.3). On turn 5 Bot1 controls
# Forest, Tropical Island (a Forest by its type line, not its name) and Island: two Forests, so Rofellos adds exactly
# {G}{G}. Island is a land but no Forest, the Mox Emeralds are no lands at all, and Bot2's two Forests are not Bot1's
# (one more for every land, or every player's Forest, would show). Rofellos is tapped to pay its cost.

